          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_0_equation_0.jpg",
          "content": "\\begin{array}{l} \\therefore \\left[ (2 b) 2 + \\left(\\frac {3 \\sqrt {2}}{b}\\right) ^ {2} \\right] + \\left[ (2 b - b) 2 + \\left(\\frac {6 \\sqrt {2}}{b} - \\frac {3 \\sqrt {2}}{b}\\right) ^ {2} \\right] = b ^ {2} + \\left(\\frac {6 \\sqrt {2}}{b}\\right) ^ {2}, \\\\ \\therefore b = \\sqrt {3}, \\\\ \\therefore B (\\sqrt {3}, 2 \\sqrt {6}), D (2 \\sqrt {3}, \\sqrt {6}), \\\\ \\end{array}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.051,
            0.234,
            0.448,
            0.265
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "∴ 直线 OB 的解析式为:  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "y = 2\\sqrt{2}x"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , ∴ 直线 DF 的解析式为:  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "y = 2\\sqrt{2}x - 3\\sqrt{6}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , 当 y = 0 时,  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2\\sqrt{2}x - 3\\sqrt{6} = 0"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.203,
            0.268,
            0.301,
            0.452
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_0_equation_2.jpg",
          "content": "\\begin{array}{l} \\therefore x = \\frac {3 \\sqrt {3}}{2}, \\\\ \\therefore F \\left(\\frac {3 \\sqrt {3}}{2}, 0\\right) \\\\ \\because O E = \\sqrt {3}, O F = \\frac {3 \\sqrt {3}}{2}, \\\\ \\therefore E F = O F - O E = \\frac {\\sqrt {3}}{2}, \\\\ \\therefore \\frac {E F}{O E} = \\frac {1}{2}, \\\\ \\end{array}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.057,
            0.464,
            0.152,
            0.505
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "故答案为: "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{1}{2},\\left(\\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{2},0\\right)"
            }
          ]
        },
