              "content": "不等式(1)，得 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "x > 3"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，解不等式(2)，得 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "x \\geqslant -3"
            },
